  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WSSCC is a global multi-stakeholder partnership organization focusing on improving the lives of poor people. WSSCC has about 1,500 individual members in more than 160 countries. WSSCC aims at enhancing collaboration among sector agencies and professionals on sanitation supply. WSSCC works with Networking &amp; Knowledge Management, Advocacy &amp; Communications and the Global Sanitation Fund.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">WSSCC &#xe4;r ett globalt partnerskap som fokuserar p&#xe5; att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra livet f&#xf6;r fattiga m&#xe4;nniskor. WSSCC har cirka 1500 enskilda medlemmar i mer &#xe4;n 160 l&#xe4;nder. WSSCC syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra samarbetet mellan sektorns myndigheter och yrkesverksamma om sanitet utbudet. WSSCC arbetar med N&#xe4;tverk &amp; Knowledge Management, opinionsbildning och kommunikation samt Globala Sanitetsfonden (GSF).</narrative>
  </description>
